{"id":"9e9fc8d665281b83","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Symmetric.md","title":"Symmetric","display":"Symmetric","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Symmetric","parameters":["w","r"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Symmetric"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>w</span><span>r</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：基础。有序参数：<code>w</code>、<code>r</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Symmetric w r)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall x (implies (in x w) (forall y (implies (in y w) (implies (@ Edge r x y) (@ Edge r y x))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abaf67a121eca170\" href=\"?note=abaf67a121eca170\" title=\"ZFC_Edge\">Edge</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Symmetric w r)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Edge","status":"resolved","id":"abaf67a121eca170","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Edge|Edge]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":780,"backlinks":[{"id":"170e22e2feddb645","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]"},{"id":"6c535786457e5cab","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_ConverseWF|ConverseWF]]；[[ZFC_Euclidean|Euclidean]]；[[ZFC_MFlags|MFlags]]；[[ZFC_Nonempty|Nonempty]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Num1|Num1]]；[[ZFC_Num2|Num2]]；[[ZFC_Num3|Num3]]；[[ZFC_Num4|Num4]]；[[ZFC_Num5|Num5]]；[[ZFC_Reflexive|Reflexive]]；[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Serial|Serial]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]"},{"id":"558dd759e3fb9283","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_RelationOn|RelationOn]]；[[ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]；[[ZFC_Transitive|Transitive]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-166","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_Symmetric|Symmetric]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","abaf67a121eca170","593f9bdab4d60707"]}